[f753c9b3] 2026-10-28T03:00:50.350Z: A run with 2000 notes and many threads can be overwhelming. When checking FIPS codes, always remember to pad both state and county codes to 5 characters.
[a0384841] 2026-10-28T02:20:52.268Z: Pad decimal hours to two places when comparing with 24hr clock — I had a nasty date mismatch until I caught that.
